// Email input component properties
[fmdb:inputEmail] > jnt:content, fmdbmix:element, fmdbmix:profileMappableField, fmdbmix:emailField, fmdbmix:textField, fmdbmix:textValidationMessages
 - helpText (string, richtext[ckeditor.toolbar='FormidableHelp',ckeditor.customConfig='$context/modules/formidable-engine/javascript/ckeditor/helpTextConfig.js']) i18n indexed=no
 - required (boolean) = false
 - multiple (boolean) = false
 - placeholder (string) i18n indexed=no
 - defaultValue (string) i18n indexed=no
 - list (string) i18n multiple indexed=no
 - pattern (string) indexed=no
 - minLength (long)
 - maxLength (long)
 // Simple string: 'on' (default), 'off', or any HTML5 autocomplete token
 - autocomplete (string) = 'on' autocreated indexed=no
